#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which of Ditana's repositories a problem belongs in, and what a useful report contains."
msgstr "En tge repositori da Ditana ch’in problem tutga, e tge ch’in rapport nizzaivel cuntegna."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reporting a bug"
msgstr "Annunziar in’errur"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"Ditana is developed in three repositories, and the right one follows from "
"two questions: **did the problem appear while installing, or while using an "
"installed system?** And if it is an installed system, **is it the packaging "
"or the configuration?**"
msgstr ""
"Il svilup da Ditana ha lieu en trais repositoris, ed il repositori correct "
"resulta da duas dumondas: **è il problem cumparì durant l’installaziun u "
"durant l’utilisaziun d’in sistem installà?** E sch’i sa tracta d’in sistem "
"installà: **pertutga il problem il pachetar u la configuraziun?**"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"**[ditana-installer](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/issues)** — "
"the ISO and the installation process. The live environment does not boot; "
"the installer stops with an error; disk partitioning or encryption fails; "
"the installed system does not boot at all; something you selected in the "
"installer's dialogs did not end up on the installed system."
msgstr ""
"**[ditana-installer](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-installer/issues)** – "
"l’ISO ed il process d’installaziun. L’ambient live na s’aviescha betg; "
"l’installatur sa ferma cun in’errur; il partiziunament dal disc u il "
"criptadi na reussescha betg; il sistem installà na s’aviescha insumma betg; "
"insatge che Vus avais tschernì en ils dialogs da l’installatur n’è betg "
"arrivà sin il sistem installà."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"**[ditana-build](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-build/issues)** – the "
"packages themselves and the pipeline that builds them. A missing dependency, "
"a package that will not install, a signature that does not verify, a package "
"that is out of date."
msgstr ""
"**[ditana-build](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-build/issues)** – ils "
"pachets sezs e la pipeline che als construescha. Ina dependenza che manca, "
"in pachet che na sa lascha betg installar, ina signatura che na sa lascha "
"betg verifitgar, in pachet antiquà."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"**[ditana-config](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-config/issues)** — what "
"an installed Ditana system *is*. Package selection, desktop configuration, "
"defaults and dotfiles, systemd units, kernel parameters and CPU mitigations, "
"Ditana's own helper scripts. If the system boots and something in it is "
"wrong or missing, this is the place."
msgstr ""
"**[ditana-config](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-config/issues)** – quai "
"ch’in sistem Ditana installà *è*. Selecziun dals pachets, configuraziun dal "
"desktop, valurs da standard e dotfiles, unitads systemd, parameters dal "
"kernel e mitigiaziuns da la CPU, ils agens scripts d’agid da Ditana. Sch’il "
"sistem s’aviescha ed insatge en el è fallà u manca, è quai il dretg lieu."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"If you cannot tell, open it in **ditana-config** and say so — it is easier "
"to move an issue than to have it go unreported."
msgstr ""
"Sche Vus na savais betg decider, avri l’issue en **ditana-config** e "
"menziunai quai – igl è pli simpel da spustar in issue che da na survegnir "
"nagin rapport."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid "A useful report contains:"
msgstr "In rapport nizzaivel cuntegna:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"The Ditana version and the configuration it was installed with, from `grep "
"-E '^(BUILD_ID|VERSION_CODENAME)=' /etc/os-release`, and the kernel from "
"`uname -r`."
msgstr ""
"La versiun da Ditana e la configuraziun cun la quala il sistem è vegnì "
"installà, sco che `grep -E '^(BUILD_ID|VERSION_CODENAME)=' /etc/os-release` "
"las mussa, ed il kernel, sco che `uname -r` al mussa."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"What you expected, what happened, and the exact command or click that "
"produced it."
msgstr ""
"Tge che Vus avais spetgà, tge ch’è capità ed il cumond exact u il clic exact "
"che ha chaschunà quai."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid "The relevant error, copied as text rather than photographed."
msgstr "L’errur relevanta, copiada sco text e betg fotografada."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"For an installer problem: `/var/log/install_ditana.log`, which the installer "
"also copies into the installed system."
msgstr ""
"Per in problem cun l’installatur: `/var/log/install_ditana.log`, che "
"l’installatur copiescha er en il sistem installà."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"For a service that fails: `systemctl status <unit>` and `journalctl -u "
"<unit> -b`."
msgstr ""
"Per in servetsch che fallescha: `systemctl status <unit>` e `journalctl -u "
"<unit> -b`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"For a hardware problem: `print-system-infos`, which is installed by default "
"with the terminal tools and summarizes CPU, GPU, memory and firmware in one "
"screen. Install it with `pacman -S ditana-print-system-infos` if you "
"unchecked that option."
msgstr ""
"Per in problem cun la hardware: `print-system-infos`, ch’è installà sco "
"standard cun ils utensils dal terminal e che resumescha CPU, GPU, memoria e "
"firmware sin in sulet visur. Installai il program cun `pacman -S ditana-"
"print-system-infos`, sche Vus avais deactivà questa opziun."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/reporting-a-bug.md
msgid ""
"Please do not report AUR packages here. Ditana rebuilds their recipes from "
"the AUR unchanged; if the software itself is broken, the AUR page or the "
"upstream project is where a fix can actually be made. If the *packaging* in "
"Ditana’s repository is at fault – a missing dependency, a package that will "
"not install – that is a ditana-build issue and we do want to hear about it."
msgstr ""
"Per plaschair n’annunziai betg pachets AUR qua. Ditana reconstruescha lur "
"recepts da l’AUR senza als midar; sche la software sezza è defecta, è la "
"pagina da l’AUR u il project d’origin il lieu nua ch’ina correctura po "
"effectivamain vegnir fatga. Sch’il problem è il *pachetar* en il repositori "
"da Ditana – ina dependenza che manca, in pachet che na sa lascha betg "
"installar –, è quai in issue da ditana-build, e quai vulain nus absolutamain "
"vegnir a savair."
